# Mid-Run Floor Enforcer Policy (P1)

**Status:** P1-candidate

## Policy
Orchestrator MUST run floor checks after builders complete and before Reviewer-Verifier final pass. Any unmet BLOCKING floor halts closure.

## Blocking Floors
| Metric | Floor |
|--------|-------|
| Source files | 80 |
| Exports | 300 |
| API endpoints | 40 |
| DB tables | 15 |
| Test files | 20 |
| Modules covered | 13 |

## Non-Blocking (Warn)
| Metric | Floor |
|--------|-------|
| Error states | 30 |

## Recovery
On block: Orchestrator returns deficit list. Builder remedies. Re-check required.
